      "number": 23,
      "answer": "$36$",
      "solution": "드모르간의 법칙에 의하여 $A^{C} \\cup B^{C}=(A \\cap B)^{C}$이므로\n$n(A^{C} \\cup B^{C})=n((A \\cap B)^{C})=n(U)-n(A \\cap B)$\n그런데 $n(A \\cup B)=n(A)+n(B)-n(A \\cap B)$이므로\n$34=21+17-n(A \\cap B)$, 즉 $n(A \\cap B)=4$\n따라서 $n(A^{C} \\cup B^{C})=n(U)-n(A \\cap B)=40-4=36$",
      "topic": "",
      "difficulty": ""
